	measure LT_Win% = ```
			VAR SelectedDate = ALLSELECTED ( Vergleichszeitpunkt[Timestamp] )
			VAR Result =
			    CALCULATE (
			        MAX ( 'Sales_Pipeline_ITY'[Win %] ),
			        KEEPFILTERS ( 'Sales_Pipeline_ITY'[Timestamp] IN SelectedDate )
			    )
			RETURN
			    Result
			```
